@startuml
actor "Workflow engine" as wf
participant "Compute node" as node
participant "Object storage" as store
participant "ores.ore" as ore
participant "Reporting service" as reporting
participant "Market data service" as marketdata
database "Result tables" as results
database "Market state tables" as state

== The engine prices, and the node leaves its output behind ==
node -> node : run the engine
node -> store : upload the output archive
note right of node : the whole output directory, the run's audit copy
node -> store : upload each file, compressed, and a manifest
note right of node : the manifest names each file, its size and its digest

== Post-processing reads it ==
wf -> reporting : post_process_results(run, skipped families)
reporting -> store : fetch each result's manifest
loop each result file the run stores, one at a time
  reporting -> store : fetch the file
  store --> reporting : its text, checked against its digest
  reporting -> ore : read it, by family, a block at a time
  ore --> reporting : a block of rows
  reporting -> results : insert the block
end
reporting -> results : commit the run's rows, once
reporting -> marketdata : store_market_state(manifests, run token, skipped families)
marketdata -> store : fetch each market-state file
marketdata -> ore : read_metrics, read_calibration, read_market_inputs
ore --> marketdata : scenario, calibration and input values
marketdata -> state : one row for each value
reporting --> wf : the run's result summary

== What a screen reads ==
actor "Screen" as screen
screen -> results : the run result view
note right of results : the view names each engine heading once
@enduml
